OL,3,AIran war reshapes Brics ties but also
OL,4,Aexposes divisions
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis weekend, some of the most powerful
OL,7,Fpeople in the world gathered in Delhi
OL,8,Faround a vast circular table.
OL,10,FIndian Prime Minister Narendra Modi
OL,11,Fannounced that together, the leaders
OL,12,Fnext to him should increasingly become
OL,13,F"rule-shapers", not "rule-takers".
OL,15,FAmong those listening were members of
OL,16,Fthe Brics group, including Chinese
OL,17,FPresident Xi Jinping, Russian President
OL,18,FVladimir Putin, Iran's President Masoud
OL,19,FPezeshkian, Abu Dhabi's Crown Prince
OL,20,FSheikh Khaled bin Mohamed bin Zayed Al
OL,21,FNahyan and South African President
OL,22,FCyril Ramaphosa.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
